// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`renders a family search form as recorded 1`] = `
"<form class="space-y-4 variant-search-workspace"><div class="variant-search-header"><div class="variant-search-meta"><div class="variant-search-toolbar"><button type="submit" class="form-button">Apply filters</button><select aria-label="Preset or saved search"><option value="">Preset or saved search</option><optgroup label="Built-in presets"><option value="built-in:phenotype_priority">Phenotype priority (Exomiser-style)</option><option value="built-in:dominant_strict">Dominant strict</option><option value="built-in:dominant_relaxed">Dominant relaxed</option><option value="built-in:expanded_carrier_screening">Expanded carrier screening</option><option value="built-in:compound_het">Compound het</option><option value="built-in:recessive_hom">Recessive hom</option><option value="built-in:recessive_permissive">Recessive broad</option><option value="built-in:any_affected">Any affected</option><option value="built-in:clinvar_review">ClinVar review</option></optgroup></select><button type="button" class="button-secondary">Save current</button><button type="button" class="button-secondary">Clear all filters</button></div></div></div><section class="variant-search-section"><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-grid"><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Phenotype</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">Prioritization off</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox"><span>Phenotype prioritization</span></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><p class="table-subtle">Rank candidate variants by how well each gene matches the affected individuals’ HPO phenotypes (Monarch / Exomiser-style).</p></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Structural second hit</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">Off</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox"><span>Also hit by an SV</span></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><p class="table-subtle">Restrict to variants whose gene is also hit by a structural variant — the cross-type “second hit” (e.g. an SNV plus an overlapping deletion). Matches are tagged with the SV type and a trans/cis phase badge.</p></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Inheritance</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">2 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Inheritance model</span><select aria-label="Quick inheritance"><option value="all">All</option><option value="de_novo_dominant">De novo/dominant</option><option value="recessive_homozygous">Recessive homozygous</option><option value="compound_het">Compound heterozygous</option><option value="x_linked">X-linked</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Quality</span><select aria-label="Quick call quality"><option value="all_variants">All</option><option value="high_quality">High</option><option value="all_passing">Passing</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Couple-based expanded carrier screening</label><p class="table-subtle">Restricts results to genes where both MOM and DAD carry a variant, and to variants a female partner carries on chrX outside the pseudo-autosomal regions: for an X-linked condition her carrier status alone puts a son at risk. A partner whose sex is not recorded counts as female.</p><div class="variant-sample-grid"><div class="variant-sample-row"><div class="variant-sample-heading"><span class="variant-sample-title">♂ PROBAND</span><div class="variant-sample-meta"><span class="table-chip">proband</span><span class="table-chip badge-chip--signature">affected</span></div></div><div class="variant-sample-controls"><div class="variant-gt-toggle-row"><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Homozygous alt, including hemizygous/haploid calls (1) and 2/2 at multi-allelic sites"><input type="checkbox">Hom</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Heterozygous, including multi-allelic calls such as 1/2 and half calls such as ./1"><input type="checkbox">Het</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Reference, including haploid 0, no-calls and samples without a call at the site"><input type="checkbox">WT</label></div><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--4"><input placeholder="GQ / QUAL ≥" value="20"><input placeholder="DP ≥" value="10"><input placeholder="AF ≥" value=""><input placeholder="AD alt ≥" value=""></div></div></div><div class="variant-sample-row"><div class="variant-sample-heading"><span class="variant-sample-title">♀ MOM</span><div class="variant-sample-meta"><span class="table-chip">mother</span><span class="table-chip ">unaffected</span></div></div><div class="variant-sample-controls"><div class="variant-gt-toggle-row"><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Homozygous alt, including hemizygous/haploid calls (1) and 2/2 at multi-allelic sites"><input type="checkbox">Hom</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Heterozygous, including multi-allelic calls such as 1/2 and half calls such as ./1"><input type="checkbox">Het</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Reference, including haploid 0, no-calls and samples without a call at the site"><input type="checkbox">WT</label></div><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--4"><input placeholder="GQ / QUAL ≥" value=""><input placeholder="DP ≥" value=""><input placeholder="AF ≥" value=""><input placeholder="AD alt ≥" value=""></div></div></div><div class="variant-sample-row"><div class="variant-sample-heading"><span class="variant-sample-title">♂ DAD</span><div class="variant-sample-meta"><span class="table-chip">father</span><span class="table-chip ">unaffected</span></div></div><div class="variant-sample-controls"><div class="variant-gt-toggle-row"><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Homozygous alt, including hemizygous/haploid calls (1) and 2/2 at multi-allelic sites"><input type="checkbox">Hom</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Heterozygous, including multi-allelic calls such as 1/2 and half calls such as ./1"><input type="checkbox">Het</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Reference, including haploid 0, no-calls and samples without a call at the site"><input type="checkbox">WT</label></div><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--4"><input placeholder="GQ / QUAL ≥" value=""><input placeholder="DP ≥" value=""><input placeholder="AF ≥" value=""><input placeholder="AD alt ≥" value=""></div></div></div></div><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--3"><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">Any variant type</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--compact"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">SNV</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">INDEL</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">MNV</label></div></div><input placeholder="Callset / source" value="" name="source"><input placeholder="Phase set" value="" name="ps"></div></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Pathogenicity</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">1 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Quick</span><select aria-label="Quick pathogenicity"><option value="all">All</option><option value="path_likely_path">P/LP</option><option value="not_benign">Not benign</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">ClinVar status</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" checked="">Pathogenic</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Likely pathogenic</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Uncertain significance</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Likely benign</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Benign</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Conflicting classifications</label></div></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Annotations</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">1 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Quick</span><select aria-label="Quick annotations"><option value="all">All</option><option value="high_impact">High</option><option value="moderate_to_high">Mod+High</option><option value="all_coding">Coding</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><div class="variant-annotation-impact-groups"><div class="variant-annotation-impact-group"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-impact-title-row"><input type="checkbox" checked=""><span class="variant-annotation-impact-title">HIGH</span></label><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">frameshift variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">stop gained</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">stop lost</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">start lost</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">splice acceptor variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">splice donor variant</label></div></div><div class="variant-annotation-impact-group"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-impact-title-row"><input type="checkbox"><span class="variant-annotation-impact-title">MODERATE</span></label><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">missense variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">inframe insertion</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">inframe deletion</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">protein altering variant</label></div></div><div class="variant-annotation-impact-group"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-impact-title-row"><input type="checkbox"><span class="variant-annotation-impact-title">LOW</span></label><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">synonymous variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">splice region variant</label></div></div><div class="variant-annotation-impact-group"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-annotation-impact-title-row"><input type="checkbox"><span class="variant-annotation-impact-title">MODIFIER</span></label><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">coding sequence variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">splice donor 5th base variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">splice donor region variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">splice polypyrimidine tract variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">intron variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">motif feature variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">TF binding site variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">regulatory region variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">upstream gene variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">downstream gene variant</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">non coding transcript exon variant</label></div></div></div><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--4"><input placeholder="Transcript" value="" name="transcript"><input placeholder="dbSNP / rsID" value="" name="rsid"><input placeholder="HGVS.c" value="" name="hgvsc"><input placeholder="HGVS.p" value="" name="hgvsp"></div><div class="variant-gt-toggle-row"><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Canonical only</label><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">MANE only</label><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">LoF only</label></div></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">In Silico</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">1 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--5"><input placeholder="CADD ≥" value="20" name="min_cadd"><input placeholder="REVEL ≥" value="" name="min_revel"><input placeholder="SpliceAI ≥" value="" name="min_spliceai"></div><div class="variant-inline-controls"><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">SIFT</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">deleterious</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">deleterious low confidence</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">tolerated</label></div></div><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">PolyPhen</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">probably damaging</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">possibly damaging</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">benign</label></div></div></div><p class="table-subtle">Variants matching any selected predictor are returned. Numeric thresholds are interpreted as greater-than-or-equal filters.</p></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Frequency</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">1 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Quick</span><select aria-label="Quick frequency"><option value="all">All</option><option value="gnomad_rare">gnomAD &lt;1%, H/H &lt;=10</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><div class="variant-frequency-slider-grid"><div class="variant-frequency-slider-row"><div class="variant-frequency-slider-header"><span>gnomAD AF</span><span>1%</span></div><input min="0" max="10" step="0.1" type="range" value="1"><button type="button" class="button-secondary variant-frequency-clear">Clear</button></div><div class="variant-frequency-slider-row"><div class="variant-frequency-slider-header"><span>gnomAD popmax AF</span><span>Any</span></div><input min="0" max="10" step="0.1" type="range" value="0"><button type="button" class="button-secondary variant-frequency-clear">Clear</button></div><div class="variant-frequency-slider-row"><div class="variant-frequency-slider-header"><span>gnomAD exomes AF</span><span>Any</span></div><input min="0" max="10" step="0.1" type="range" value="0"><button type="button" class="button-secondary variant-frequency-clear">Clear</button></div><div class="variant-frequency-slider-row"><div class="variant-frequency-slider-header"><span>gnomAD genomes AF</span><span>Any</span></div><input min="0" max="10" step="0.1" type="range" value="0"><button type="button" class="button-secondary variant-frequency-clear">Clear</button></div><div class="variant-frequency-slider-row"><div class="variant-frequency-slider-header"><span>TOPMed AF</span><span>Any</span></div><input min="0" max="10" step="0.1" type="range" value="0"><button type="button" class="button-secondary variant-frequency-clear">Clear</button></div></div><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--4"><input placeholder="gnomAD AC ≤" value="" name="max_gnomad_ac"><input placeholder="gnomAD H/H ≤" value="" name="max_gnomad_hom_count"><input placeholder="gnomAD hemi ≤" value="" name="max_gnomad_hemi_count"></div><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" checked=""><span>ClinVar pathogenic / likely pathogenic overrules the frequency filter</span></label></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Locations</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">1 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Panel</span><select aria-label="Quick gene panel" name="panel_id"><option value="">Any gene panel</option><option value="panel-1">Mendeliome</option></select></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><textarea name="gene" rows="3" placeholder="Gene list: BRCA1
BRCA2
TP53"></textarea><textarea name="intervals" rows="3" placeholder="Intervals: chr13:32315086-32400266
chr17:43044295-43125482"></textarea></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Exclude</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">1 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Quick</span><select aria-label="Quick exclude"><option value="all">None</option><option value="benign_likely_benign">Benign/Likely benign</option><option value="excluded_tag">Excluded tag</option><option value="excluded_and_benign">Excluded + benign</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">Excluded ClinVar status</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Pathogenic</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Likely pathogenic</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Uncertain significance</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Likely benign</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Benign</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Conflicting classifications</label></div><div class="variant-review-curation-columns"><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">Excluded standard tags</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Review</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Likely Pathogenic - class 4</label></div></div><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">Excluded custom tags</p><p class="table-subtle">No custom tags available.</p></div></div><textarea name="exclude_gene" rows="3" placeholder="Excluded genes: TTN
MUC4">TTN</textarea><textarea name="exclude_intervals" rows="3" placeholder="Excluded intervals: chr1:1000-5000"></textarea></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Review and curation</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">1 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Quick</span><select aria-label="Quick review"><option value="all">All</option><option value="pathogenic_vus">P/LP/VUS</option><option value="review_tag">Review tag</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><div class="variant-review-curation-columns"><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">Classification</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Pathogenic - class 5</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Likely Pathogenic - class 4</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">VUS - class 3</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Likely benign - class 2</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Benign - class 1</label></div></div><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">Standard tags</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" checked="">Review</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Likely Pathogenic - class 4</label></div></div><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">Custom tags</p><p class="table-subtle">No custom tags available.</p></div></div><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Only show variants with saved notes</label></div></details></div></section></form>"
`;

exports[`renders the Global Small Variant Explorer form as recorded 1`] = `
"<form class="space-y-4 variant-search-workspace"><div class="variant-search-header"><div class="variant-search-meta"><div class="variant-search-toolbar"><button type="submit" class="form-button">Apply filters</button><button type="button" class="button-secondary">Clear all filters</button></div></div></div><section class="variant-search-section"><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-grid"><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Pathogenicity</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">1 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Quick</span><select aria-label="Quick pathogenicity"><option value="all">All</option><option value="path_likely_path">P/LP</option><option value="not_benign">Not benign</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">ClinVar status</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--small"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" checked="">Pathogenic</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Likely pathogenic</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Uncertain significance</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Likely benign</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Benign</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Conflicting classifications</label></div></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="varia