exports[`renders the monogenic NIPT form as recorded 1`] = `
"<form class="space-y-4 variant-search-workspace"><div class="variant-search-header"><div class="variant-search-meta"><div class="variant-search-toolbar"><button type="submit" class="form-button">Apply filters</button><select aria-label="Preset or saved search"><option value="">Preset or saved search</option><optgroup label="Built-in presets"><option value="built-in:phenotype_priority">Phenotype priority (Exomiser-style)</option><option value="built-in:dominant_strict">Dominant strict</option><option value="built-in:dominant_relaxed">Dominant relaxed</option><option value="built-in:expanded_carrier_screening">Expanded carrier screening</option><option value="built-in:compound_het">Compound het</option><option value="built-in:recessive_hom">Recessive hom</option><option value="built-in:recessive_permissive">Recessive broad</option><option value="built-in:any_affected">Any affected</option><option value="built-in:clinvar_review">ClinVar review</option></optgroup></select><button type="button" class="button-secondary">Save current</button><button type="button" class="button-secondary">Clear all filters</button></div></div></div><section class="variant-search-section"><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-grid"><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Phenotype</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">Prioritization off</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox"><span>Phenotype prioritization</span></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><p class="table-subtle">Rank candidate variants by how well each gene matches the affected individuals’ HPO phenotypes (Monarch / Exomiser-style).</p></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Structural second hit</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">Off</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox"><span>Also hit by an SV</span></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><p class="table-subtle">Restrict to variants whose gene is also hit by a structural variant — the cross-type “second hit” (e.g. an SNV plus an overlapping deletion). Matches are tagged with the SV type and a trans/cis phase badge.</p></div></details><details class="variant-filter-dropdown"><summary class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-copy"><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-title">Inheritance</span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-meta">2 active</span></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-summary-controls" role="presentation"><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Inheritance model</span><select aria-label="Quick inheritance"><option value="all">All</option><option value="de_novo_dominant">De novo/dominant</option><option value="recessive_homozygous">Recessive homozygous</option><option value="compound_het">Compound heterozygous</option><option value="x_linked">X-linked</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label><label class="variant-summary-select-field"><span>Quality</span><select aria-label="Quick call quality"><option value="all_variants">All</option><option value="high_quality">High</option><option value="all_passing">Passing</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label></span><span class="variant-filter-dropdown-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></summary><div class="variant-filter-dropdown-content"><label class="analysis-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">Couple-based expanded carrier screening</label><p class="table-subtle">Restricts results to genes where both MOM and DAD carry a variant, and to variants a female partner carries on chrX outside the pseudo-autosomal regions: for an X-linked condition her carrier status alone puts a son at risk. A partner whose sex is not recorded counts as female.</p><div class="variant-sample-grid"><div class="variant-sample-row"><div class="variant-sample-heading"><span class="variant-sample-title">♂ PROBAND</span><div class="variant-sample-meta"><span class="table-chip">proband</span><span class="table-chip badge-chip--signature">affected</span></div></div><div class="variant-sample-controls"><div class="variant-gt-toggle-row"><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Homozygous alt, including hemizygous/haploid calls (1) and 2/2 at multi-allelic sites"><input type="checkbox">Hom</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Heterozygous, including multi-allelic calls such as 1/2 and half calls such as ./1"><input type="checkbox">Het</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Reference, including haploid 0, no-calls and samples without a call at the site"><input type="checkbox">WT</label></div><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--4"><input placeholder="GQ / QUAL ≥" value="20"><input placeholder="DP ≥" value="10"><input placeholder="AF ≥" value=""><input placeholder="AD alt ≥" value=""></div></div></div><div class="variant-sample-row"><div class="variant-sample-heading"><span class="variant-sample-title">♀ MOM</span><div class="variant-sample-meta"><span class="table-chip">mother</span><span class="table-chip ">unaffected</span></div></div><div class="variant-sample-controls"><div class="variant-gt-toggle-row"><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Homozygous alt, including hemizygous/haploid calls (1) and 2/2 at multi-allelic sites"><input type="checkbox">Hom</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Heterozygous, including multi-allelic calls such as 1/2 and half calls such as ./1"><input type="checkbox">Het</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Reference, including haploid 0, no-calls and samples without a call at the site"><input type="checkbox">WT</label></div><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--4"><input placeholder="GQ / QUAL ≥" value=""><input placeholder="DP ≥" value=""><input placeholder="AF ≥" value=""><input placeholder="AD alt ≥" value=""></div></div></div><div class="variant-sample-row"><div class="variant-sample-heading"><span class="variant-sample-title">♂ DAD</span><div class="variant-sample-meta"><span class="table-chip">father</span><span class="table-chip ">unaffected</span></div></div><div class="variant-sample-controls"><div class="variant-gt-toggle-row"><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Homozygous alt, including hemizygous/haploid calls (1) and 2/2 at multi-allelic sites"><input type="checkbox">Hom</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Heterozygous, including multi-allelic calls such as 1/2 and half calls such as ./1"><input type="checkbox">Het</label><label class="analysis-checkbox" title="Reference, including haploid 0, no-calls and samples without a call at the site"><input type="checkbox">WT</label></div><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--4"><input placeholder="GQ / QUAL ≥" value=""><input placeholder="DP ≥" value=""><input placeholder="AF ≥" value=""><input placeholder="AD alt ≥" value=""></div></div></div></div><div class="analysis-filter-grid analysis-filter-grid--3"><div><p class="variant-annotation-impact-title">Any variant type</p><div class="variant-checkbox-grid variant-checkbox-grid--compact"><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">SNV</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">INDEL</label><label class="analysis-checkbox variant-compact-checkbox"><input type="checkbox">MNV</label></div></d